+               'comparison_policy': 'ABC reference for available compatible Layer1 metrics; first measured compatible point for new workloads and V2. Explicit workload-definition IDs permit comparing identical transaction shapes despite run-specific outpoints; raw fixture hashes remain in runtime_fixture_provenance. Older runs without definition IDs retain strict raw-fixture grouping. Kernel columns are separated by declared workload identity; unidentified historical kernel fixtures are isolated by source prefix. No line joins across the V2 boundary. Percent is raw/reference*100, not signed speedup.'}
